Vendored SteerViT inference code
================================

Files: __init__.py, model.py, backbone.py, crossattention.py, utils.py
Source: https://github.com/manugaurdl/SteerViT  (src/steervit/), commit d385b7c3 (2026-06-13)
        byte-identical to https://github.com/JonaRuthardt/SteerViT commit 3d9eee14 (2026-09-02)
Paper:  Ruthardt, Gaur, Ramanan, Tapaswi, Asano. "Steerable Visual Representations" (SteerViT),
        arXiv 2604.02327.
Licence: the upstream pyproject.toml declares `license = {text = "MIT"}`; the upstream repository
        ships no LICENSE file. The MIT terms as declared upstream apply to these five files; the
        rest of cuvis-ai-steervit is Apache-2.0 (see the repository LICENSE).
Weights: steervit_dinov2_base.pth from https://huggingface.co/JonaRuthardt/SteerViT (Apache-2.0),
        downloaded at node construction and stored in the pipeline weights afterwards.
Local changes: a provenance header per file and package-relative imports (`from steervit.x` ->
        `from .x`). Re-sync with tools/sync_vendor.py; the pinned ref lives in .upstream-sync.yml.

